e path=3D"/" component=3D{Home} /&gt;</code></strong> : Cette route affiche=
 la page d'accueil lorsque l'URL est <code data-start=3D"6924" data-end=3D"=
6927">/</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"7047" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6931" data-end=3D"7047" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
