e path=3D"/about" component=3D{About} /&gt;</code></strong> : Cette route a=
ffiche la page "=C3=80 propos" lorsque l'URL est <code data-start=3D"7038" =
data-end=3D"7046">/about</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7048" data-end=3D"7220" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7050" data-end=3D"7220" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
