<h3 data-start=3D"2920" data-end=3D"2950" class=3D"">Explication de l'exemp=
le :</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2952" data-end=3D"4495">
<li data-start=3D"2952" data-end=3D"3321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2955" data-end=3D"2994" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
955" data-end=3D"2991">Contexte global (<code data-start=3D"2974" data-end=
=3D"2988">UserProvider</code>)</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2998" data-end=3D"3321">
<li data-start=3D"2998" data-end=3D"3317" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3000" data-end=3D"3317" class=3D"">Ici, nous utilisons un =
<strong data-start=3D"3023" data-end=3D"3041">Contexte React</strong> pour =
g=C3=A9rer l'=C3=A9tat global de l'application. Par exemple, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"3098" data-end=3D"3111">UserContext</code> peut contenir des informat=
ions sur l'utilisateur connect=C3=A9 (comme son nom, son ID, ses pr=C3=A9f=
=C3=A9rences, etc.), que nous souhaitons partager entre plusieurs composant=
s sans avoir =C3=A0 passer les props manuellement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3322" data-end=3D"3945" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3325" data-end=3D"3373" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
325" data-end=3D"3371">React Router (<code data-start=3D"3341" data-end=3D"=
3349">Router</code>, <code data-start=3D"3351" data-end=3D"3358">Route</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3368">Switch</code>)</strong> :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"3377" data-end=3D"3945">
<li data-start=3D"3377" data-end=3D"3591" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3379" data-end=3D"3591" class=3D"">Nous utilisons <code da=
ta-start=3D"3394" data-end=3D"3409">BrowserRouter</code> (alias <code data-=
start=3D"3417" data-end=3D"3425">Router</code>) pour g=C3=A9rer la navigati=
on c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client. Cela permet de cr=C3=A9er des applications =C3=A0=
 page unique (SPA), o=C3=B9 les diff=C3=A9rentes pages sont rendues sans re=
chargement de la page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3767" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3597" data-end=3D"3767" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"359=
7" data-end=3D"3604">Route</code> d=C3=A9finit les diff=C3=A9rentes routes =
et les composants associ=C3=A9s. Par exemple, la route <code data-start=3D"=
3686" data-end=3D"3691">'/'</code> affiche la page d'accueil, et la route <=
code data-start=3D"3731" data-end=3D"3741">'/about'</code> affiche la page =
=C3=A0 propos.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3771" data-end=3D"3945" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3773" data-end=3D"3945" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"377=
3" data-end=3D"3781">Switch</code> garantit que seule la premi=C3=A8re rout=
e correspondant =C3=A0 l'URL actuelle est rendue, ce qui est particuli=C3=
=A8rement utile pour =C3=A9viter de rendre plusieurs routes =C3=A0 la fois.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3947" data-end=3D"4255" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3950" data-end=3D"3974" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
950" data-end=3D"3972">Composants globaux</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3978" data-end=3D"4255">
<li data-start=3D"3978" data-end=3D"4137" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3980" data-end=3D"4137" class=3D"">Nous avons deux composa=
nts globaux qui sont affich=C3=A9s sur toutes les pages de l'application : =
<code data-start=3D"4073" data-end=3D"4081">Navbar</code> (la barre de navi=
gation) et <code data-start=3D"4110" data-end=3D"4118">Footer</code> (le pi=
ed de page).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4141" data-end=3D"4255" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4143" data-end=3D"4255" class=3D"">Ces composants sont pla=
c=C3=A9s =C3=A0 l'ext=C3=A9rieur des routes sp=C3=A9cifiques pour qu'ils so=
ient rendus sur toutes les pages.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4495" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4260" data-end=3D"4289" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
260" data-end=3D"4287">Pages (<code data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4275">H=
ome</code>, <code data-start=3D"4277" data-end=3D"4284">About</code>)</stro=
ng> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4293" data-end=3D"4495">
<li data-start=3D"4293" data-end=3D"4495" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4295" data-end=3D"4495" class=3D"">Chaque page de l'applic=
ation (ici, <code data-start=3D"4330" data-end=3D"4336">Home</code> et <cod=
e data-start=3D"4340" data-end=3D"4347">About</code>) est un composant Reac=
t distinct qui contient la logique et le rendu de chaque vue. Ces pages son=
t rendues en fonction de l'URL de la route active.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4497" data-end=3D"4579" class=3D"">Exemple avec Redux (si=
 vous utilisez Redux pour la gestion de l'=C3=A9tat global) :</h3>
